{"suttaId":"sn13.11","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-ii","vriCode":"s0302m.mul","paras":[662,669],"vripara":"84"},"segments":{"sn13.11:0.3":"Tatiyapabbatasuttaṃ","sn13.11:1.1":"Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … pe …","sn13.11:1.2":"“seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, puriso sinerussa pabbatarājassa satta muggamattiyo pāsāṇasakkharā upanikkhipeyya.","sn13.11:1.3":"Taṃ kiṃ maññatha, bhikkhave,","sn13.11:1.4":"katamaṃ nu kho bahutaraṃ, yā vā satta muggamattiyo pāsāṇasakkharā upanikkhittā yo vā sineru [upanikkhittā, sineru vā (sī.)] pabbatarājā”ti?","sn13.11:2.1":"“Etadeva, bhante, bahutaraṃ yadidaṃ sineru pabbatarājā;","sn13.11:2.2":"appamattikā satta muggamattiyo pāsāṇasakkharā upanikkhittā.","sn13.11:2.3":"Neva satimaṃ kalaṃ upenti na sahassimaṃ kalaṃ upenti na satasahassimaṃ kalaṃ upenti sineruṃ pabbatarājānaṃ upanidhāya satta muggamattiyo pāsāṇasakkharā upanikkhittā”ti.","sn13.11:3.1":"“Evameva kho, bhikkhave, ariyasāvakassa diṭṭhisampannassa puggalassa adhigamaṃ upanidhāya aññatitthiyasamaṇabrāhmaṇaparibbājakānaṃ adhigamo neva satimaṃ kalaṃ upeti na sahassimaṃ kalaṃ upeti na satasahassimaṃ kalaṃ upeti.","sn13.11:3.2":"Evaṃ mahādhigamo, bhikkhave, diṭṭhisampanno puggalo, evaṃ mahābhiñño”ti.","sn13.11:3.3":"Ekādasamaṃ.","sn13.11:3.4":"Abhisamayasaṃyuttaṃ samattaṃ.","sn13.11:4.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","sn13.11:4.1":"Nakhasikhā pokkharaṇī,","sn13.11:4.2":"sambhejjaudake ca dve;","sn13.11:4.3":"Dve pathavī dve samuddā,","sn13.11:4.4":"tayo ca pabbatūpamāti."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0302a.att","from":484,"to":488,"paras":[{"para":484,"vripara":"78-84","refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["78-84. Pañcame <b>mahāpathaviyā</b>ti cakkavāḷabbhantarāya mahāpathaviyā uddharitvā.","<b>Kolaṭṭhimattiyo</b>ti padaraṭṭhipamāṇā.","<b>Guḷikā</b>ti mattikaguḷikā.","<b>Upanikkhipeyyā</b>ti ekasmiṃ ṭhāne ṭhapeyya.","Chaṭṭhādīsu vuttanayeneva attho veditabbo.","Pariyosāne pana <b>aññatitthiyasamaṇabrāhmaṇaparibbājakānaṃ adhigamo</b>ti bāhirakānaṃ sabbopi guṇādhigamo paṭhamamaggena adhigataguṇānaṃ satabhāgampi sahassabhāgampi satasahassabhāgampi na upagacchatīti.","Pañcamādīni."],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"],["sn13.11:1"],["sn13.11:1"],["sn13.11:1"],["sn13.11:1"],["sn13.11:1"],["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":485,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["Abhisamayasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":486,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["Dhātusaṃyuttaṃ"],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":487,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["Nānattavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":488,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["Dhātunānattasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0302t.tik","from":475,"to":483,"paras":[{"para":475,"vripara":"78-84","refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["78-84. <b>Cakkavāḷabbhantarāyā</b>ti cakkavāḷapabbatassa antogadhāya."],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":476,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["<b>Chaṭṭhādīsu vuttanayenevā</b>ti idha chaṭṭhasuttādīsu paṭhamasuttādīsu vuttanayenevāti attho veditabbo visesābhāvato."],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":477,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["<b>Pariyosāne</b>ti imassa abhisamayasaṃyuttassa osānaṭṭhāne.","<b>Aññatitthiyasamaṇabrāhmaṇaparibbājakānan</b>ti aññatitthiyānaṃ.","<b>Guṇādhigamo</b>ti jhānābhiññāsahito guṇādhigamo.","<b>Satabhāgampi … pe … na upagacchati</b> saccapaṭivedhassa mahānubhāvattā.","Tenāha bhagavā paccakkhasabbadhammo “evaṃ mahādhigamo, bhikkhave, diṭṭhisampanno puggalo evaṃ mahābhiñño”ti."],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"],["sn13.11:1"],["sn13.11:1"],["sn13.11:1"],["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":478,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["Pathavīsuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":479,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["Sāratthappakāsiniyā saṃyuttanikāya-aṭṭhakathāya"],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":480,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["Abhisamayasaṃyuttavaṇṇanāya līnatthappakāsanā samattā."],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":481,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["Dhātusaṃyuttaṃ"],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":482,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["Nānattavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]},{"para":483,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn13.11:1"],"lines":["Dhātunānattasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn13.11:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
